# Scoped to apps/metadata-fetcher-api/Dockerfile — BuildKit reads
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to a root one, so the rest of the
# monorepo keeps its own build rules.
#
# The context is the repository root, which is ~1.2 GB installed. This trims
# it to a few megabytes. Plain exclusions rather than the "exclude everything,
# then re-include" idiom: re-including a path under an excluded parent behaves
# differently between builders, and the Dockerfile already copies only the
# four workspaces it needs.

# generated — the image builds its own
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.test
**/.nx
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode

# workspaces this image has no use for (the demo and e2e fixtures alone are
# ~80 MB of epubs, comics and pdfs)
apps/demo
apps/front
apps/tests
prose-react-native-demo
gitbook
